    <title>Scaling and evaluating sparse autoencoders</title>
    <summary>Sparse autoencoders provide a promising unsupervised approach for extracting
interpretable features from a language model by reconstructing activations
from a sparse bottleneck layer. We find k &lt; 100 works.</summary>
